<title>POLAND: Zloty fixed just weaker at 3.04 pct from parity.</title>
<headline>Zloty fixed just weaker at 3.04 pct from parity.</headline>
<dateline>WARSAW 1997-04-04</dateline>
<text>
<p>The National Bank of Poland fixed the zloty at 3.0735 to the dollar, down from 3.0685 on Thursday and at 1.8340 to the mark, up from 1.8355, the NBP said.</p>
<p>The central bank fixed the zloty at an average of 3.04 percent from the weighted dollar and mark parity rates, just weaker than Thursday's 3.05 percent fix.</p>
<p>-- Warsaw Newsroom +48 22 653 9700</p>
</text>
